        <mxCell id="title1" parent="1" style="text;html=1;fontStyle=1;fontSize=15;fontColor=#2d6a2d;" value="PHAN 1 -- DA CO TRONG CODE HOM NAY (23 du an .NET + 1 workspace frontend; build sach 0 loi 0 canh bao)" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="26" width="1300" x="40" y="-50" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="client" parent="1" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#ffe6cc;strokeColor=#d79b00;fontSize=11;" value="Web SPA (frontend/apps/web)&#xa;React 19 + Vite, cong 5173&#xa;3 man hinh: San pham (/) - Gio hang (/basket) - Xac nhan (/confirmation)&#xa;CHI goi DUY NHAT dia chi Gateway (5300) -- ep buoc bang cau truc code&#xa;Ma goi API sinh tu dong tu OpenAPI cua BFF (packages/api-client)" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="110" width="460" x="30" y="50" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="sd" parent="1" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#dae8fc;strokeColor=#6c8ebf;fontSize=11;" value="shared/ServiceDefaults&#xa;(thu vien dung chung, KHONG phai service)&#xa;- OpenTelemetry: log / trace / metric&#xa;- Correlation-Id (X-Correlation-Id): sinh o Gateway,&#xa;  ghi vao request de moi hop sau dung chung 1 ma" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="110" width="280" x="860" y="50" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="tenancy" parent="1" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#dae8fc;strokeColor=#6c8ebf;fontSize=11;" value="shared/Tenancy&#xa;(thu vien dung chung, KHONG phai service)&#xa;- TenantContext.RequireTenantId() (tu 003)&#xa;- MOI (004): CallerContext.RequireSubjectId()&#xa;- Header: X-Tenant-Id + X-Subject-Id&#xa;- Chan MOI ket noi CSDL neu thieu 1 trong 2" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="110" width="260" x="1160" y="50" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="gw" parent="1" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#e1d5e7;strokeColor=#9673a6;fontSize=11;" value="Gateway.Api (services/gateway) -- YARP&#xa;Cong 5300&#xa;Bang route = 1 dong duy nhat: MOI duong dan -&gt; BFF&#xa;StubIdentity: xac thuc LUON thanh cong, gan co dinh&#xa;tenant &quot;contoso&quot; + nguoi dung &quot;phase1-stub-user&quot;, ghi de&#xa;ca X-Tenant-Id va X-Subject-Id (khong tin gia tri tu ngoai)" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="140" width="460" x="30" y="200" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="gwnote" parent="1" style="text;html=1;fontSize=10;fontColor=#666666;whiteSpace=wrap;align=left;" value="Vi sao 1 route catch-all: neu Gateway phai liet ke tung duong dan cua BFF thi&#xa;moi lan BFF them tinh nang lai phai sua + deploy Gateway.&#xa;&#xa;StorefrontCorsTests canh dung viec CHI web SPA (5173) duoc phep goi qua CORS&#xa;-- 1 loi CORS that da bi bat va sua trong qua trinh lam tinh nang 004." vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="140" width="650" x="510" y="200" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="bff" parent="1" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#e1d5e7;strokeColor=#9673a6;fontSize=11;" value="Bff.Api (services/bff) -- Backend For Frontend&#xa;Cong 5301  |  KHONG co co so du lieu&#xa;GET /bff/products, GET/POST /bff/basket,&#xa;POST /bff/basket/items, GET /bff/orders/{id}&#xa;MOI: POST /bff/checkout -- dieu phoi 3 buoc (xem ghi chu duoi)&#xa;TenantPropagationHandler: gan lai CA X-Tenant-Id lan X-Subject-Id" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="120" width="460" x="30" y="380" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="bffnote" parent="1" style="text;html=1;fontSize=10;fontColor=#666666;whiteSpace=wrap;align=left;" value="Ngan sach thoi gian cho MOI loi goi ra ngoai: 1 giay / lan thu (toi da 2 lan lai) | toi da 3 giay tong cong | cau dao ngat sau 10s loi lien tuc&#xa;502 = downstream khong ket noi duoc / cau dao da ngat    504 = vuot thoi gian cho    500 = loi cua chinh BFF    404 = khong tim thay (KHONG phai loi)&#xa;&#xa;POST /bff/checkout -- dieu phoi dong bo 3 buoc, theo DUNG thu tu nay (co chu dich, xem docs/adr/0011):&#xa;  1. Doc gio hang hien tai (goi Baskets)   2. Gio RONG -&gt; dung ngay, tra loi 409, KHONG tao don&#xa;  3. Tao don hang tu cac dong hang (goi Orders)   4. XOA gio hang (goi Baskets) -- CHI SAU KHI da co don hang that&#xa;Day la dieu phoi dong bo do BFF tu lam, KHONG phai saga/outbox theo dung chuan thiet ke muc tieu -- sai lech co ghi chep, co thoi han (ADR-0011, SCRUM-18/31)." vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="150" width="890" x="510" y="330" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="svcnote" parent="1" style="text;html=1;fontSize=10;fontColor=#666666;whiteSpace=wrap;" value="4 service nghiep vu HOAN TOAN khong biet den nhau: khong cai nao goi cai nao, khong cai nao tham chieu code cua cai nao." vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="20" width="1390" x="30" y="525" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="svc1" parent="1" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#d5e8d4;strokeColor=#82b366;fontSize=10;" value="Products.Api&#xa;Cong 5088&#xa;GET /products -- NAY CO 3 SAN PHAM MAU THAT (seed migration)&#xa;+ /health/live, /health/ready&#xa;Bang: Product (Id, Name, Price)&#xa;Chan doc/ghi CSDL neu thieu X-Tenant-Id / X-Subject-Id" vertex="1">
