        <mxCell id="fnote" parent="1" style="text;html=1;fontSize=10;fontColor=#a03030;whiteSpace=wrap;" value="Cac khoi nay moi la quyet dinh trong ADR / ban ve trong docs/system-design.md, hoac (voi &quot;Ngan cach vat ly theo tenant&quot;) da thu va bi huy giua chung khi trien khai -- chua co dong code chay that nao cho chung. Web SPA, Gateway, BFF, va co che tenant+nguoi goi gia lap DA o Phan 1, khong con la ke hoach nua." vertex="1">
